			"notes": "ADDED\n- Added NeoForge 1.21.11 support.\n- Added Fabric 1.21.11 support.\n\nCHANGED\n- Forge and NeoForge no longer store collision data in saved entities.\n- Jar names now follow `collisiondamage-<loader>-<version>-<mc>.jar`.\n- The code has been improved:\n  - The collision math now lives in common code.\n  - Each loader's handler and packet files are merged into its main class.\n  - The files are 32% smaller.\n  - Unused properties and helpers are removed.\n  - The build now uses Gradle 9.4 and Architectury Loom 1.17."
		},
